      "writtenOn": "2019-08-28T17:48:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the code, registerForHandoverStateChanged notifies TelephonyConnection with a MSG_HANDOVER_STATE_CHANGED event. If registerForHandoverStateChanged(null) is called, the connection will be null in MSG_HANDOVER_STATE_CHANGED and the\n    if (connection !\u003d null \u0026\u0026 ....\ncall will be false. This will cause the call to be stuck.",
